{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1787354427610676001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"anthropoid-trophied-moose","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"0961f915e83fb9f6666029ddaffea82dd9d9c236de5300d190a62a537ea829ba","event_uuid":"e715374f-9174-4347-ad11-f4a7e3286aa7","position":{"commit_sha":"a304b6992dd6331df3f28e23e2f0726d2baa6ca1","position":"1787352354398276001-e715374f-9174-4347-ad11-f4a7e3286aa7"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"7341dd1c557b5bc72f02fe6db54386da0011bd95ebde6b06b403783a17e83161","event_uuid":"16a088cc-0284-4d01-9e7b-e00022ce0355","position":{"commit_sha":"3a564cd9360033f75d910cbddbe870c08c74dcce","position":"1787352359797088001-16a088cc-0284-4d01-9e7b-e00022ce0355"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1787352354398276001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[],"description":"## Context / Problem\nAbout twenty single-turn LLM call sites build a `RunRequest` (`src/rebar/llm/runner.py:80-143`) and only two bound output tokens, one bounds retries and timeout: `overlap/judge.py:163` (`judge_one`, inherits the generic 16k/600s) vs `judge_batch:203` (bounded — bug `leathery-druidic-nurseshark`, now inverted), `workflow/runs.py:346`, `completion_recovery.py:307,404`, `plan_review/passes.py:286,388,469,520,582`, `xcheck.py:199,337`, `completion_subcall.py:193`, `prerequisites.py:231`, `fidelity_spot_eval.py:103,115` (no model-class binding), `enrich.py:183`, `epic_bug_screen.py:266`, `code_review/workflow_ops.py:604`. `structured_run.build_usage_limits:393-438` returns the bare limit while `completion_banking.iteration_limit_for:278-285` inverts it, so successor budgets can be off by the retry allowance (part of the `creatable-foldable-arthropods` / `earthen-flayed-baboon` / `binary-cobwebby-bittern` family). RP-01 owns provider retry semantics and is not changed.\n\n## Approach\nAdd `RunRequest.for_structured(cfg, *, model_class, output_tokens, timeout_s, structured_retries=0, transport_attempts=1, iteration_limit=None)` in `structured_run.py` with keyword-only, required bounds (no inherit-by-omission), and make `build_usage_limits` return the allowance-inclusive value so `iteration_limit_for` cannot drift. Adopt at every single-turn site with each site's *current effective* values, so behaviour is unchanged. Guard: `RunRequest(` constructed directly outside `runner.py`/`structured_run.py` only at the agentic sites (`operations.py`, `spec_scan.py`, `interpreter.py`), listed explicitly in the test.\n\n## Scope\n`src/rebar/llm/structured_run.py`, `src/rebar/llm/runner.py`, `src/rebar/llm/workflow/completion_banking.py`, the call sites listed above, `tests/unit/llm/test_run_request_builder.py` (new).\n\n## Testing\nTable test: every adopted site's request carries the same bounds as before the change (snapshot taken from the current tree). Edge: omitting a bound is a `TypeError` at construction. Pinning: `tests/unit/test_subcall_class_selection.py`, `tests/unit/test_overlap_judge.py`, `tests/unit/test_completion_budget.py`, `tests/unit/workflow/test_completion_banking.py` pass unchanged.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] `judge_one` and `judge_batch` declare the same bound set; checked by the builder test.\n- [ ] `iteration_limit_for(build_usage_limits(...))` round-trips to the same value on every budget in the fixture set; checked by a property test.\n- [ ] Pinning suites pass unchanged; checked by `pytest`.\n","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/llm/structured_run.py","reason":"consolidation edit or new shared module/test"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/runner.py","reason":"consolidation edit or new shared module/test"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/workflow/completion_banking.py","reason":"consolidation edit or new shared module/test"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/overlap/judge.py","reason":"consolidation edit or new shared module/test"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/workflow/runs.py","reason":"consolidation edit or new shared module/test"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/workflow/completion_recovery.py","reason":"consolidation edit or new shared module/test"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/plan_review/passes.py","reason":"consolidation edit or new shared module/test"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/plan_review/xcheck.py","reason":"consolidation edit or new shared module/test"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/plan_review/fidelity_spot_eval.py","reason":"consolidation edit or new shared module/test"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/enrich.py","reason":"consolidation edit or new shared module/test"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/code_review/workflow_ops.py","reason":"consolidation edit or new shared module/test"},{"path":"tests/unit/llm/test_run_request_builder.py","reason":"consolidation edit or new shared module/test"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["parent","2ddd-b523-06da-4b4a"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"2ddd-b523-06da-4b4a","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["consolidation","janitor","fortnight-review"],"ticket_id":"44ff-2ad0-e994-4da7","ticket_type":"story","title":"RunRequest.for_structured builder with required bounds for single-turn LLM calls","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["e715374f-9174-4347-ad11-f4a7e3286aa7","16a088cc-0284-4d01-9e7b-e00022ce0355"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787354427610676001,"uuid":"c7f869fe-5b96-4e3c-834b-f117b8117bd6"}